# Membership expiry with the profile's own timers: robustness 2, query
# interval 30 s, response 5 s, so 65 s. A refresh at 40 moves the deadline to
# 105; the row survives the tick at 104 and is removed at 105. The PON's drop
# of unregistered multicast comes on once the learning window (65 s from the
# policy appearing) has passed.
0 policy
snooping=1
igmp_function=0
immediate_leave=0
robustness=2
query_interval=30
query_max_response=5
end
0 tick
10 v2join 1 0 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.1
40 v2join 1 0 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.1
64 tick
65 tick
66 tick
104 tick
105 tick
106 state
